%O0001 (PF GAS TEST - 5 SEC DWELL
%(Description: Turn ON PF Gas, Dwell for 5 Seconds, Turn OFF PF Gas)

G90 G94

;(--- 1. TURN ON PF GAS ---)
M64 P24       (PF Gas ON - I/O Bit 24)

;(--- 2. DWELL FOR 5 SECONDS ---)
G04 P5        (Dwell 5 sec - use G04 P5000 if your controller uses ms)

;(--- 3. TURN OFF PF GAS ---)
M65 P24       (PF Gas OFF)

M30           (Program End & Reset)
